  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**BODMAS rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/aacb9b5c9c0e66a9d27b184ff5f4793344022e762e948f5afcad76a2b1508286.png] \n\n1. 15 and 16\n\nGiven equation: 15 × 7 + 64 – 80 ÷ 16 = 181\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers, we get:\n\nL.H.S = 16 × 7 + 64 – **__80 ÷ 15__**\n\n= __**16 **____**× 7**__ + 64 – 5.34\n\n= **__112 + 64__** - 5.34\n\n= 176 - 5.34\n\n= 170.66 ≠ R.H.S\n\n2. 16 and 64\n\nGiven equation: 15 × 7 + 64 – 80 ÷ 16 = 181\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers, we get:\n\nL.H.S = 15 × 7 + 16 – **__80 ÷ 64__**\n\n= **__15 __****__× 7__** + 16 – 1.25\n\n= __**105 + 16**__ – 1.25\n\n= 121 - 1.25 \n\n= 119.75 ≠ R.H.S\n\n3. 7 and 16\n\nGiven equation: 15 × 7 + 64 – 80 ÷ 16 = 181\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers, we get:\n\nL.H.S = 15 × 16 + 64 – __**80 ÷ 7**__\n\n= **__15 × 16__** + 64 – 11.4\n\n= **__240 + 64__ **– 11.4\n\n= 304 - 11.4\n\n= 292.6 ≠ R.H.S\n\n4. 64 and 80\n\nGiven equation: 15 × 7 + 64 – 80 ÷ 16 = 181\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers, we get:\n\nL.H.S = 15 × 7 + 80 – __**64 ÷ 16**__\n\n= __**15 × 7**__ + 80 – 4\n\n= __**105 + 80**__ - 4\n\n= 185 - 4\n\n= 181 = R.H.S\n\nHence, '**64 and 80**' is the correct answer.",
